<Base title="Isaac Assistant" description="Isaac Assistant: a private tool for managing personal email and calendar.">
	<h1>Isaac Assistant</h1>
	<p>
		Isaac Assistant is a private, personal tool that helps Isaac Egglestone plan his day by bringing his personal and
		family Gmail and Google Calendar together with his work schedule.
	</p>
	<p>It runs locally on his own machine and is not available to the public.</p>
	<p>See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for how data is handled.</p>
</Base>
